        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVTtZzosVm1mcePINXmEFsuuD-ty8T_G0zvYxjk1pG5m8ro6rwr=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "This is a very interesting business. I wasn't sure what to expect and was pleasantly surprised. I was looking for lactose-free chocolate ice cream for my partner, since the grocery store in our town almost never carries it.\n\nFor lactose-free ice cream, there are many different flavor choices, more than at the grocery store. The flavors I tried were very good; they were flavorful and had a good, pronounced taste. Especially raspberry, which isn't available on its own anywhere else.\n\nThey also have various lactose-free products; it's not just ice cream they sell. This place is truly a great find for people with lactose intolerance, like my partner.\n\nThe prices are okay, reasonable, and modest. Slightly more expensive than at the grocery store, but the difference in taste justifies the price.\n\nThe place is primarily a pick-up and order counter location; there's no seating or tables for eating in.\n\nThe atmosphere is quite calm.",
        "time": 1765226506,
        "translated": true
